# "Whenever Lightning deals combat damage to a player, until your next turn, if a source would deal damage to that player or a
# permanent that player controls, it deals double that damage instead." Bot1 attacks Bot2 with Lightning (3/2, first strike,
# lifelink) and Memnite (1/1). Lightning's first-strike damage is 3 (Bot2 to 17, Bot1 to 23 by lifelink). Its trigger resolves
# before the regular combat damage step, so Memnite's 1 damage is doubled to 2 (Bot2 to 15). Lightning's own damage, dealt
# before the effect existed, was not doubled, and the lifelink gain is for the 3 Lightning dealt (Bot1 stays at 23).

